  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "ObjectInspector is a presentation layer component responsible for dynamically displaying and allowing modification of properties for a selected target object within the editor UI. It abstracts property access, filtering properties based on allow/deny lists, and rendering appropriate UI controls based on property type. It manages state changes by mutating the object's internal property structure and notifies the application of updates via the EditorService."
  },
